<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull], a seasoned [asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction] from [asker_faction_name], just barely escaped a deadly ambush. With [asker_possessive] enemies hot on [asker_possessive] trail, [asker_pronoun] needs backup fast. Protect [asker_objective] at [map_definite] until reinforcements arrive, and [asker_pronoun] promises a cut of [royalFavorReward] [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel].\nThe group of [enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] is composed of:\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]\n\n[asker_nameDef] is too busy dodging bullets to give more details.</li>
    <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull], one of the slickest [asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction] in [asker_faction_name], barely slipped away from an ambush gone wrong. Now, [asker_possessive] enemies are closing in fast, and [asker_pronoun] needs help staying alive until backup comes. Meet [asker_nameDef] at [map_definite], keep [asker_pronoun] safe, and you'll be rewarded with [royalFavorReward] [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel].\nThe group of [enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] is composed of:\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]\n\n[asker_nameDef] is too shaken up to give more details.</li>
    <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull], a key figure in [asker_faction_name], walked into a trap. With [asker_possessive] guards dead and [asker_pronoun] on the run, there's little time to lose. [asker_pronoun] needs backup at [map_definite] to fend off the enemies until the heat dies down. [asker_pronoun] promises [royalFavorReward] [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] in exchange.\nThe group of [enemyFaction_pawnsPlural] is composed of:\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]\n\n[asker_nameDef] is too frantic to explain more.</li>
  -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull]，来自[asker_faction_name]的一位经验丰富的[asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction]，刚刚勉强逃脱了一次致命伏击。在[asker_possessive]敌人紧追不舍的情况下，[asker_pronoun]急需支援。在[map_definite]保护[asker_objective]直到援军到达，[asker_pronoun]承诺给予[royalFavorReward][asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]作为回报。\n[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]小组由以下成员组成：\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]\n\n[asker_nameDef]忙于躲避子弹，无法提供更多细节。</li>
    <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull]，[asker_faction_name]中最狡猾的[asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction]之一，勉强摆脱了一次失败的伏击。现在，[asker_possessive]敌人正在快速逼近，[asker_pronoun]需要帮助在援军到来前活下来。在[map_definite]与[asker_nameDef]会面，保护[asker_pronoun]的安全，你将获得[royalFavorReward][asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]作为奖励。\n[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]小组由以下成员组成：\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]\n\n[asker_nameDef]过于震惊，无法提供更多细节。</li>
    <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull]，[asker_faction_name]中的一位关键人物，落入了陷阱。在[asker_possessive]卫兵死亡且[asker_pronoun]在逃亡中，时间紧迫。[asker_pronoun]需要在[map_definite]的支援以击退敌人直到风头过去。[asker_pronoun]承诺给予[royalFavorReward][asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]作为交换。\n[enemyFaction_pawnsPlural]小组由以下成员组成：\n[raid/raidPawnKinds]\n\n[asker_nameDef]过于慌乱，无法进一步解释。</li>
  </OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
