  <!-- EN: {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to protect, has had {SUBJECT_possessive} xenogerm forcibly absorbed. Because of this violation, {SUBJECT_pronoun} will now attempt to leave. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->
  <OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>你被委托保护的{SUBJECT_definite}的异种基因被强制吸收。由于这种违规行为，{SUBJECT_pronoun}现在将尝试离开。[failLetterEndingCommon]</OE_Quest_HuntedAgent.root.nodes.askerXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
